{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-B-truth-server-database-3-a-01","date":"2026-11-25","lens":"2","surface":"server","area":"server/database-3","refs":["F-server-533","F-server-512"],"severity":"S3","title":"The web page AI helper charges the gym for answers it holds back as 'I will ask the gym'","what":"When a visitor asks the AI helper on the gym's web page, one paid answer is taken from the gym's AI credits before the AI is asked. If the AI's reply is then blocked by the safety check (it named a price, phone number or web address not on the page) or the AI itself says it does not know, the visitor only sees 'I will ask the gym', yet the paid answer is kept. Only a reply that fails completely is given back. So the owner pays for answers nobody received, and these are exactly the chats that also need the owner's own reply.","expected":"An answer the visitor never got (held back or 'I do not know') does not count against the gym's credits, the same as a failed one.","evidence":["deploy/panel/pageChat.js:388-391","deploy/panel/pageChat.js:374","supabase/migrations/0094_page_chat.sql:17-19","supabase/migrations/0083_ai_members.sql:186-198"],"proof":"code-read","root_cause_key":"held-back-answer-still-charged","who":"gym owners with the web page AI helper on","how_often":"every held-back or unknown answer","fix_line":"Give the counted answer back when the reply shown is 'I will ask the gym'","fix_size":"small","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open"}
